1
00:00:00,846 --> 00:00:04,846
(Sheldon:)But whoever that mystery man was,
you should be eternally grateful...

2
00:00:05,017 --> 00:00:08,477
(Sheldon:)...for without him,
there would be no Leonard's Day.

3
00:00:09,438 --> 00:00:10,518
(Leonard:)Leonard's Day?

4
00:00:10,689 --> 00:00:13,229
(Sheldon:)No pressure,
just get him a crummy card, you're good.

5
00:00:17,363 --> 00:00:19,903
All right, test my ringtone.

6
00:00:20,074 --> 00:00:21,824
(Raj:)ELTON JOHN
Rocket man

7
00:00:21,992 --> 00:00:24,582
Burning out his fuse up here alone

8
00:00:24,745 --> 00:00:29,085
- It really is a good song.
- Yeah, there's a reason he's Sir EIton John.

9
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:33,040
(Raj:)They don't make you a knight for writing
"Wake Me Up Before You Go-Go."

10
00:00:34,380 --> 00:00:36,840
(Raj:)Howard,
are you coming down for breakfast?

11
00:00:37,007 --> 00:00:41,057
(Howard:)Ma, I told you, I have a video conference
with NASA! I said don't bother me!

12
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:44,350
Ooh, listen to Mr. Big-Shot-Astronaut!

13
00:00:44,515 --> 00:00:48,055
(Howard:)Yes, please listen
to Mr. Big-Shot-Astronaut!

14
00:00:52,731 --> 00:00:54,271
(Howard:)Hey. Good morning.

15
00:00:54,441 --> 00:00:57,021
(NASA Guy(on skype):)Hey, Howard.
Thanks for getting up so early.

